<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1010 440" width="1010" height="440" font-family="Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif">
  <style>
    .lb{font-size:11px;fill:#1c2430}
    .sm{font-size:9.5px;fill:#5a6472}
    .ti{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;fill:#1c2430}
    .hd{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;fill:#1c2430}
    .ax{stroke:#8b95a3;stroke-width:1}
    .gr{stroke:#e2e7ee;stroke-width:1}
  </style>

  <text class="ti" x="30" y="24">Fig. 4 — The trade-off measured, not assumed: parameters fall ≈61×, epoch time rises ≈5×</text>

  <!-- left: parameters -->
  <text class="hd" x="60" y="62">Trainable parameters (millions)</text>
  <line class="ax" x1="60" y1="300" x2="440" y2="300"/>
  <g class="gr">
    <line x1="60" y1="250" x2="440" y2="250"/><line x1="60" y1="200" x2="440" y2="200"/>
    <line x1="60" y1="150" x2="440" y2="150"/><line x1="60" y1="100" x2="440" y2="100"/>
  </g>
  <text class="sm" x="34" y="304">0</text><text class="sm" x="28" y="254">10</text>
  <text class="sm" x="28" y="204">20</text><text class="sm" x="28" y="154">30</text>

  <rect x="96" y="163" width="76" height="137" fill="#3a6ea5" rx="3"/>
  <text class="lb" x="134" y="153" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">27.43</text>
  <text class="sm" x="134" y="318" text-anchor="middle">GMedMamba</text>
  <text class="sm" x="134" y="331" text-anchor="middle">hierarchical (RGB)</text>

  <rect x="212" y="286" width="76" height="14" fill="#6a8fbd" rx="3"/>
  <text class="lb" x="250" y="278" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">2.77</text>
  <text class="sm" x="250" y="318" text-anchor="middle">GMedMamba</text>
  <text class="sm" x="250" y="331" text-anchor="middle">HSI preset</text>

  <rect x="328" y="298" width="76" height="2.4" fill="#c2703a" rx="1"/>
  <text class="lb" x="366" y="290" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#a85c26">0.447</text>
  <text class="sm" x="366" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a85c26">GMedMamba-R</text>
  <text class="sm" x="366" y="331" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a85c26">recursive</text>

  <!-- right: time -->
  <text class="hd" x="580" y="62">Wall-clock per optimizer step (ms, log scale)</text>
  <line class="ax" x1="580" y1="300" x2="960" y2="300"/>
  <g class="gr">
    <line x1="580" y1="250" x2="960" y2="250"/><line x1="580" y1="200" x2="960" y2="200"/>
    <line x1="580" y1="150" x2="960" y2="150"/><line x1="580" y1="100" x2="960" y2="100"/>
  </g>
  <text class="sm" x="548" y="304">10</text><text class="sm" x="542" y="254">100</text>
  <text class="sm" x="536" y="204">1 k</text><text class="sm" x="540" y="154">10 k</text><text class="sm" x="536" y="104">100 k</text>

  <rect x="612" y="265" width="66" height="35" fill="#3a6ea5" rx="3"/>
  <text class="lb" x="645" y="257" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">58</text>
  <text class="sm" x="645" y="318" text-anchor="middle">hierarchical</text>

  <rect x="708" y="200" width="66" height="100" fill="#c2703a" rx="3"/>
  <text class="lb" x="741" y="192" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#a85c26">501</text>
  <text class="sm" x="741" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a85c26">recursive</text>
  <text class="sm" x="741" y="331" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a85c26">mlp mixer</text>

  <rect x="804" y="106" width="66" height="194" fill="#9b3f3f" rx="3"/>
  <text class="lb" x="837" y="98" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#8a3232">66,880</text>
  <text class="sm" x="837" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8a3232">recursive</text>
  <text class="sm" x="837" y="331" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8a3232">ss2d mixer</text>

  <text class="sm" x="580" y="356">Bars 1–2 are like-for-like at the epoch level: ≈5 min vs ≈24 min per epoch over the same 740,800 samples.</text>
  <text class="sm" x="580" y="370">Bar 3 is the recursive model with the mixer flag changed and no other fix applied (fp32, reconstruction on, batch 150):</text>
  <text class="sm" x="580" y="384">a pure-Python selective scan called 168× per step, turning a 25-minute epoch into a measured 92-hour one.</text>

  <text class="sm" x="60" y="356">All measurements: RTX 5060 Ti (16 GB), torch 2.11 + CUDA 12.8, bf16; batch 256 for the recursive bars, 150 for the hierarchical one,</text>
  <text class="sm" x="60" y="370">PAD-UFES-20 patches of 11×11×3, six classes. Gradient checkpointing on for the recursive core.</text>
  <text class="sm" x="60" y="410" font-style="italic">Without checkpointing the 0.44 M-parameter model exhausts 16 GB of VRAM — the clearest single statement of what recursion costs.</text>
</svg>
